<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom max share repurchase price NZ$9.</title>
<headline>Telecom max share repurchase price NZ$9.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand on Wednesday said the maximum share price for on-market share repurchases under its NZ$1 billion share buyback programme would be NZ$9.00.</p>
<p>The announcement was made in accordance with market regulations which require the disclosure of a maximum price for on-market share repurchases, Telecom said.</p>
<p>The company stressed that it was not obliged to pay $9.00 or any other price, and was merely nominating such a price in order to comply with the listing rule.  </p>
<p>&quot;Repurchases will be made at the prevailing market price for Telecom shares when it is in the market,&quot; Telecom said.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
